From 84ecd1f066dbc7b118702cd227b1221ec42923c5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: neatnoise <neatnoise@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 15:29:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(linux/wlr): enable Vulkan encoding for wlroots capture

Intersect Vulkan driver modifiers with compositor modifiers before
creating GBM buffers to ensure compatible buffer formats.
